    actionsDescription: "Grants <b><color=#15c>+1</color></b> <b><color=#760>defense</color></b>
      and heals <b><color=#15c>+1</color></b> <b><color=#583>HP</color></b> to me.\n\u2694\uFE0F
      Melee attack, with <b><color=#15c>+2</color></b> <b><color=#900>attack</color></b>
      if I have attacked before during this round.\nGrants <b><color=#15c>+2</color></b>
      <b><color=#760>defense</color></b> to me and I absorb attacks targetted to
      allies next to me who are <b><color=#714>\u2693 defenders</color></b>.\n"
